phase id=G00 title="Scope, current baseline and acceptance contract" serves_ref=runbook.intent state=unstarted deps=none semantic_owner=implementation_lead accountable_custodian=implementation_lead reviewer=independent_reviewer acceptor=independent_reviewer output="baseline manifest with application SHA, handover SHA, toolchain and branch owner; resolved or explicitly blocked DECISIONS.md entries; portable pickup response"
dod id=DOD.G00 phase=G00 predicate="A cloud implementer can identify the current app, authoritative MVP scope, open decisions and next executable slice without accessing the owner computer." material_invariants="No unsupported clinical permissions or measurements; Patient records retain identity, origin and meaning; No public private-source or patient-data disclosure" consequence="Incorrect behaviour can mislead treatment, lose records or prevent independent use; assess the affected outcome, not only test totals." irreversibility="Changes remain on a reviewable branch. Data migrations preserve rollback/recovery; publication, deletion and clinical activation require explicit owner decisions." owner_constraints="Patient-only iPhone MVP; No clinician portal or clinical cloud synchronisation; No assumed approval of clinical drafts" composition_boundary="The gate must work with its prerequisite gates and the same patient/episode/session record; component success does not imply journey success." unknown_policy="Mark missing evidence not_tested or blocked with owner and wake condition. Never infer a pass from missing output." residual_tolerance="No open safety, identity, data-loss or privacy defect at acceptance. Lesser limitations need named owner approval and visible scope reduction." reopen_triggers="Affected code, dependency, data schema, capture method or platform changes; A conflicting observation; Changed owner scope or clinical source" outcome_predicate="A cloud implementer can identify the current app, authoritative MVP scope, open decisions and next executable slice without accessing the owner computer." known_failure_modes="Scope expands back to clinician backend; Author-reported fixes are labelled independently verified; Registration is confused with backup" falsifier_classes="runbook.json#/gates/0/acceptance_tests" evidence=required_before_acceptance
